sequenceDiagram
  participant Phone as 手机 App
  participant DSJ as 执法仪
  participant API as device_bind.router
  participant Svc as device_bind.service
  participant Repo as device_bind.repository
  participant Rec as recorders
  participant CC as command_call

  DSJ->>API: POST /auth/device/bind/token
  API->>Svc: create_bind_token
  Svc->>Rec: ensure_recorder / 校验公司
  Svc->>Repo: 写入 pending token
  DSJ-->>Phone: 展示二维码

  Phone->>API: POST /auth/device/bind/confirm + Bearer
  API->>Svc: confirm_bind
  Svc->>Repo: 占用表 + session_token
  Svc->>Rec: mark_active
  API->>CC: ensure_occupancy_room
  API-->>Phone: 绑定成功
